Choosing names that reveal intent can make it much easier to understand and change
code. What is the purpose of this code?
public List<int[]> getThem() {
List<int[]> list1 = new ArrayList<int[]>();
for (int[] x : theList)
if (x[0] == 4)
list1.add(x);
